# Combat lab: armies already in contact, every creature ready to act (debug placements on top
# of a normal Setup). Try: attack (3~AP), respond with Defend (Quick, 1~AP) bit by bit, play
# Flame Dart / Battle Surge / Quicken as tricks, split damage between two defenders, a Ranged
# archer (no retaliation), flyers attacking Ground (Sky → Ground), Defender on the Iron Golem.
name Combat lab
seed 5
map hexagon 3
start A 0,3
start B 0,-3
home A radius=0
home B radius=0
neutral fill terrain.fire
champion A champion.pyra
champion B champion.thorn
terraindeck A terrain.fire
terraindeck B terrain.earth
openinghand 0
noshuffle
place A creature.fire-warrior 0,1
place A creature.fire-warrior 0,1
place A creature.flame-archer 0,2
place A creature.sky-hawk 1,0
place A creature.iron-golem -1,1
place B creature.stone-brute 0,0
place B creature.marsh-lurker 0,0
place B creature.tide-caller 0,-1
place B creature.sky-hawk 0,0
place B creature.night-shade -1,0
handcard A spell.flame-dart*2 spell.battle-surge spell.firebolt
handcard B spell.quicken*2 spell.battle-surge spell.stone-shards
mana A Fire 6
mana B Water 4
mana B Earth 3
